# The subgroup operations in English (src/nlp.c, sgws): each lane's value
# of the operand over one subgroup; lane is declared u32 in 0..31.
what is the subgroup sum of x where x is a u32?
the warp sum of lane
the sum over the subgroup of lane times 2
what is the range of the subgroup sum of lane?
the inclusive prefix sum over the subgroup of lane
the exclusive prefix sum of the lanes of x where x is a u8
# a ballot, a count and the votes take a condition
the ballot of the lanes where lane is odd
the ballot of lane is even
the number of lanes where lane is less than 5
how many lanes where lane is greater than 28?
whether in any lane lane is 3
whether every lane where lane is nonnegative
# from one lane: the first active one, a given one, an xor or a rotation
the first active lane's lane times 3
the broadcast of lane
the shuffle of lane from lane 3
the broadcast of lane from lane 7
the xor shuffle of lane with 1
the lane rotation of lane by 2
# "the sum over" with an index is still an indexed sum
the sum over i from 1 to 4 of i
